gh the quantum  realm  in search of janet van dyne which makes  sense a popular avengers 4 fan theory  suggests that the heroes who didn't  dissolve into dust in infinity war  might use the quantum realm in their  quest to rescue all the people  thanos snapped away so what could all  this mean the text in the photo appears  to read the asgardian thor  wields the mighty stormbreaker in his  battle against his foes  rocket teams up with a new crew to guard  the galaxy against an even greater  threat  if this leak is legit then that new crew  line all but guarantees it that rocket  is joining the avengers  for this movie at least thor and captain  america might be rocket's closest  companions on the team  given that all three are shown wearing  the same silvery white costumes  one could theorize that the trio will  partner together on an adventure of  their own  specifically they might be slipping into  the new suits to travel through the  quantum realm  locating time vortexes skipping around  in the past  and stopping thanos from committing mass  genocide before he even gets a chance to  start  it would make sense for these three to  go on their own literal mini mission  much like the characters did in infinity  war that's kind of the only way to build  a story around a cast this big  avengers 4 co-directors joe and anthony  russo haven't confirmed much of anything  about the forthcoming superhero sequel  not even its title so we can't be  certain that these costumes are real  or if the movie will truly feature the  team using time travel to take down  thanos  it isn't uncommon for toy companies to  create alternate costumes that  characters never wear in films  a toy for infinity war showed hulk  bursting out of the hulkbuster suit  and that never happened in the movie so  maybe these suits are only for avengers  4 action figures  and not avengers 4 actors and all the  ideas about the film utilizing the  quantum realm  well they're pretty compelling theories  but until the filmmakers confirm them  they're just theories sourceless leaks  had unconfirmed speculation aside  it's clear that the pieces of the  avengers 4 puzzle are slowly but surely  starting to come together  especially now that the movie has  wrapped filming as avengers 4 inches  closer to its may 3rd 2019 launch date  and starter's official marketing  campaign we should get a better idea of  what's legitimate and what's just  another product of the ever-moving rumor  mill
 

